KITS

kits.s is Sam Banks' module from octabam (modules/kits and the file and CRC
helpers of modules/store, at f7d72906), under the licence above. Modwerk's
changes for its base (the hooks, the library and edit pool in borrowed sample
memory, the read at install, the battery-RAM copy tagged with the project),
2026, Modwerk contributors, are under the same licence.

KITS follows the design of Em's Octakit (https://github.com/emuyia/ems-octakit),
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 June Kiff, and reads its kits3a/kits3b.work
files; the slot cases its edit pool and unassigned-pattern rule cover were
found and fixed by bkkbrls-del (https://github.com/bkkbrls-del) in his OK-MS4.0
build. None of Octakit's or OK-MS4.0's code or data is included.
